**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

This organization monitors security alerts and advisories within the {{tenantName}} M365 GCC High tenant through Microsoft Defender for Endpoint, Defender for Cloud, and security alert triage procedures managed by {{variables.systemAdministrator}}.

{{#if securityAlertsActive}}
**Active Security Alerts:**
{{securityAlertsCount}} security alerts monitored through Microsoft Defender:
{{#if alerts}}
{{#each alerts}}
