**Malicious Code Protection:**
- Microsoft Defender Antivirus provides real-time protection with cloud-delivered protection enabled
- Automatic signature updates ensure current threat detection (updated multiple times daily)
- Behavior monitoring detects fileless malware, living-off-the-land attacks, and memory-based threats
- Potentially Unwanted Application (PUA) blocking enabled

