**Security Event Correlation:**
Directory audit logs ({{directoryAuditsCount}} events) provide context for security alert investigation, correlating administrative actions with detected threats.
{{/if}}

**Responsible Party:** {{variables.systemAdministrator}}

**Verification Method:** Examine Microsoft Defender alert configurations, antivirus scan status, signature update logs, PUA blocking settings, and alert response records.

